  <entry>
    <title>八声甘州</title>
    <link href="https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/ccd246d1dl.html"/>
    <id>https://yesandnoandperhaps.cn/posts/ccd246d1dl.html</id>
    <published>2026-04-03T11:01:20.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-04-03T16:06:55.046Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><script>var meting_api='https://api.injahow.cn/meting/?server=:server&type=:type&id=:id&r=:r'</script><script class="meting-secondary-script-marker" src="/js/Meting.min.js"></script><p>  缓鸳声失了，一轮将、芦伏柳深恩。积灰燕支扰猿瞳，邽去三染青纶。弱子雀啼阴烂，堂客哊沦泯。膏泽捪朱萼，难掩家洵。<br>  角逐淡云江树，有浪尖残芰，湍尾花鳞。万年瓜州水，过耳卷风蘋。十二眼、笙歌龙舫，廿四回，篸管宫人。隋堤女，禊祓上巳，不过余春。</p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">缓鸳声失了，一轮将、芦伏柳深恩。积灰燕支扰猿瞳，邽去三染青纶。弱子雀啼阴烂，堂客哊沦泯。膏泽捪朱萼，难掩家洵。角逐淡云江树，有浪尖残芰，湍尾花鳞。万年瓜州水，过耳卷风蘋。十二眼、笙歌龙舫，廿四回，篸管宫人。隋堤女，禊祓上巳，不过余春。</summary>
    
    
    
